Third-party notices

Parts of this skill (the phase-by-phase validation checklist, its per-check output
format, the anti-pattern entries, the entity and state-transition checks, the
field-traceability and step-contract checks and the review questions) are adapted from
the TrogonStack event modeling skills in https://github.com/TrogonStack/agentskills
(commit 7b249d3ee42d8b7e11fa564141ebd5fbc37aadf1): eventmodeling-validating-event-models-checklist,
eventmodeling-validating-event-models and eventmodeling-checking-completeness.
See references/provenance.md for the list of adapted material.

